[PrintTextModified Text:『魔女审判即将开始』|#0103Adv26_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『请大家务必带好自己的手机，<br>　迅速到审判庭集合』|#0103Adv26_Narrative004|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『如有不遵守者，将由看守强制带走』<br>|#0103Adv26_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛紧握拳头，<br>向审判庭走去。|#0103Adv26_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

