[PrintTextModified Text:幸存的少女们<br>已经集合到了审判庭中。|#0103Adv26_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、雪莉、梅露露。<br>可可、玛格、亚里沙。<br>还有奈叶香。|#0103Adv26_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:13_1 SubId:Middle

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:黑部奈叶香小姐，你之前去哪里了。<br>我们找你找了很久。|#0103Adv26_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也罢，现在以魔女审判优先，<br>有关黑部奈叶香小姐的处分稍后再议……|#0103Adv26_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:喂，你上次也是这么说的吧。<br>你肯定根本没认真找嘛。|#0103Adv26_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:真令人伤心啊……我明明这么努力工作……<br>唉算了。<br>赶快开始赶快结束吧。|#0103Adv26_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:七名少女站在证人席上，<br>仿佛在忍受着痛苦般，艰难地相互对视。|#0103Adv26_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，魔女审判现在开庭！|#0103Adv26_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

